# Extension dev watch

When changing the Chrome MV3 extension (`src/`, `vite.config.ts`, `manifest.json`):

1. Run **`npm run dev`** (`vite build --watch`) for interactive work, **or** run **`npm run build`** after each agent edit batch.
2. Load unpacked once from **`dist/`** in `chrome://extensions`.
3. On each save, `dist/` rebuilds. Chrome does not reload an unpacked extension or Twitch tab automatically: use the manual reload steps below after a rebuild.

**Agents:** after applying extension changes, always run **`npm run build`** (and `npm test` when relevant) before handing off. Chrome does not read `src/` directly — only `dist/`.

One-time setup per browser profile: enable the dev build from `dist/`. After that, leave `npm run dev` running during extension work.

`npm run build` performs one deterministic build. There is no supported `:9876`
reload server or automatic browser refresh in this checkout.

After a rebuild:

- Open `chrome://extensions` and click **Reload** for the unpacked extension.
- Hard-refresh the Twitch tab.
